arStrings.szText:
Used to open {c_important}Lord Zir's Hoard{/c}, requires {c_number}12{/c}.

Commonly found from:
{icon:bullet,1.2}{icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_WorldEvent,1.5} {c_highlight}World Bosses{/c} and {icon:Marker_ZoneEvent,2.2} {c_highlight}Legion Events{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}{icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_Succuboss_Idle,1.5} {c_important}Blood Maiden{/c} in {icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_Helltide, 1.5} {c_highlight}Helltide{/c} 
{icon:bullet,1.2}{icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_Undercity_Entrance, 1.5} {c_highlight}Undercity of Kurast{/c} with {c_important}Tribute of Titans{/c}

Sometimes found from:
{icon:bullet,1.2}{icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_Bounties_TurnIn, 1.5} {c_highlight}The Tree of Whispers{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2}{icon:Icon_Tooltip_Marker_MercenaryHideout, 1.5} {c_highlight}Mercenary Bartering{/c}

Only found in Torment difficulties.
